OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FShowers
OL,6,Fquite frequent early evening with some
OL,7,Fheavier outbreaks developing, before
OL,8,Fdwindling from the south late evening.
OL,9,FCloud increasing overnight to bring
OL,10,Fsome patchy rain by dawn. Southerly
OL,11,Fwinds strengthening.
OL,12,
OL,13,CWednesday:FGales developing, perhaps
OL,14,Ftouching storm force in Shetland
OL,15,Flater. Cloudy with some patchy light
OL,16,Frain by day, which turns persistent
OL,17,Fand heavier for the evening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
