OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,6,FShowery. Some heavier outbreaks
OL,7,Fappearing through to early Friday,
OL,8,Fthen turning less frequent and lighter
OL,9,Ffrom late Friday. Winds veering
OL,10,Fnorthwest on Saturday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
